# Quan Sát — cloud/admin mode configuration (optional).
#
# The app works fully without this file — no Supabase call is ever made in
# guest mode. Only fill these in if you want the optional admin login +
# cloud sync feature (v2.2). Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real
# values there; .env.local is gitignored and never committed.
#
# Where to get these values: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API.
# The anon key is safe to ship in a browser bundle by design (it only grants
# what your Row Level Security policies allow) — but NEVER put the
# `service_role` key or any admin password in a VITE_* variable, here or
# anywhere else. Those never belong in frontend code.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
